{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜《建築物管理條例》修訂方案(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-10-13-29-35qH1OrR9N.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：《建築物管理條例》修訂方案</p><p>政府早前就修訂《建築物管理條例》展開公眾諮詢，顯示對授權票設上限有保留，或研究以電子授權方式操作，當中有甚麼考慮？</p><p>嘉賓：民政事務總署署長杜潔麗</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.162949+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T00:22:49.264205+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:03.769053+00:00","content_hash":"e9c6b3fef096b982462f61650ba0d62cc0ff8fc89983b3443a2ad25ce67fa9e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}